    "date": "2026-08-24T03:11:47-07:00",
    "original_comment": "I had a very disappointing experience with Myntra and would genuinely recommend being careful before ordering from this app. I ordered a night suit around 4–5 August. When I received it, I was extremely disappointed with the quality. The fabric was very thin, uncomfortable, and felt irritating on the skin. The product was not at all as expected.\nI immediately tried to initiate a return, but I was told that the product could not be returned because it was marked as a “cash”/non-returnable item. I don’t understand this policy because I had already paid the full amount for the order.\nWhat made the experience even worse was the repeated change in the return timeline. Initially, I was told the return would be processed by 15 August, then it was changed to 20 August, and now it has been delayed again until 28 August.\n\nThis has been a very frustrating experience, especially when the product quality itself was so poor.\nMy personal experience with Myntra has been extremely disappointing. Please check the return policy and product details carefully before ordering. I personally would prefer other platforms like Amazon or Meesho for clothing purchases after this experience.\nVery poor experience. Disappointed with the product quality and return service.",
